WEBVTT

00:00:00.425 --> 00:00:06.253
In this video, you will see how to feature an event, or a winning home, so it stands out on the map.

00:00:06.253 --> 00:00:09.783
We go as far as the secure payment page, and stop there.

00:00:09.783 --> 00:00:10.762
We start on the map.

00:00:11.731 --> 00:00:13.405
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:16.262 --> 00:00:18.812
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:20.469 --> 00:00:21.449
Then tap Allow.

00:00:24.776 --> 00:00:28.224
Look at the top right corner of the map, and tap the three dots.

00:00:30.733 --> 00:00:32.797
In the menu, tap Promote your event.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.028
Listing an event is always free.

00:00:37.028 --> 00:00:40.134
This is for organizers who want to stand out.

00:00:40.134 --> 00:00:41.624
First, pick a plan.

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:46.087
There are four, and a table below the cards compares everything each one includes.

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:49.683
Every plan includes the gold Featured pin on the map.

00:00:49.683 --> 00:00:54.457
The banner adds your event as a Featured pill, in the strip at the top of the map list.

00:00:54.457 --> 00:00:58.228
And Top of the list puts your event first when people browse your area.

00:00:58.228 --> 00:01:00.463
For prices, see the Pricing page.

00:01:01.281 --> 00:01:02.953
Tap Choose on the plan you want.

00:01:04.612 --> 00:01:06.294
We will take the banner with the pin.

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:09.136
Next, pick what to feature.

00:01:09.136 --> 00:01:14.559
This list shows your events, and homes that finished first, second or third in an announced contest.

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:18.809
Is your event already on the map, but not on your account?

00:01:18.809 --> 00:01:25.495
Open Claim an existing listing, find it by name or city, and tap This is my event: claim it.

00:01:25.495 --> 00:01:29.757
If your email matches the event's own website, it is approved at once.

00:01:29.757 --> 00:01:32.414
Otherwise we check it and email you.

00:01:32.414 --> 00:01:33.361
Tap your event.

00:01:35.215 --> 00:01:40.718
This page shows exactly what you get, when it starts, when it ends, and the total, before you pay.

00:01:41.605 --> 00:01:43.021
Then tap Pay on Stripe.

00:01:45.129 --> 00:01:50.268
This opens Stripe's secure page, where you pay with a card or Cash App Pay.

00:01:50.268 --> 00:01:56.025
We stop here, because this is only a demonstration, and we never enter card details in a video.

00:01:56.887 --> 00:02:02.870
After you pay, your placement turns on by itself within a few minutes, and a receipt arrives by email.

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:04.634
There is no subscription.

00:02:04.634 --> 00:02:12.064
If your event is cancelled, email us, and we will move your placement to another of your events or refund the unused time.

00:02:12.064 --> 00:02:14.045
A winning home works the same way.

00:02:14.923 --> 00:02:18.238
That is how you feature an event or a winning home.

00:02:18.238 --> 00:02:21.881
Listing is always free, and a Featured placement is optional.

00:02:23.246 --> 00:02:25.206
Next up: Find lights near me.
